S ×3, τ 2.87 both arms, and the decode binary at ctx 85 is a clean null — worth nothing where the kernel has no rows, which is what a context-term change should look like.\n\nLadder, `DECODE_ZENITH_FINDINGS.md`, and five wiki pages updated; `COMMIT_MSG_1p5.txt` is staged for the driver to commit and push. GPU is idle, 105 GiB free, nothing left running.","ttft_ms":2083,"ttft_stream_ms":1336,"time_to_request_ms":38,"type":"result","duration_ms":4436522,"uuid":"7363f925-b17d-43fc-93ff-48c9f3d810f3"}
